Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)我饶不了你。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:16.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯托拉尔 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.35,0:00:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}竟敢让我落到这种地步。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.16,0:00:25.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不会就这样算了。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.92,0:00:38.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果传说是真的……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:45.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这前面一定有……。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.59,0:00:52.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.03,0:00:53.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就是
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:57.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}异晶界之神多恩·千尊沉睡的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多恩·千尊啊 我的命 就交给你了。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.18,0:01:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 请赐给我力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.21,0:01:36.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.72,0:01:41.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(游马)好嘞 今天一定要{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一口气跳20级。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.25,0:01:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)喂 你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.54,0:01:50.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好痛。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.73,0:01:53.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 你真是个笨蛋。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.00,0:01:55.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咦？ 刚才那是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.93,0:02:01.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(离绪)什么？ 这种感觉是。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.10,0:02:22.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 你是。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.58,0:02:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(咚)吾名乃 咚·萨赞多。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.74,0:02:28.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}向吾献上性命之人啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.57,0:02:31.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}汝之愿望为何？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:34.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚·萨赞多 我无论如何
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.46,0:02:36.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都有个想揍飞的家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.66,0:02:38.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.50,0:02:42.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 还有 九十九游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.55,0:02:45.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}咚·萨赞多 赐我 那份力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.59,0:02:48.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然如此 就去寻找地上那７张 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.34,0:02:52.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}去寻找被封印的 No.卡吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被封印的 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.77,0:02:58.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错。如此一来 吾之力便会复活。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.21,0:03:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.05,0:03:01.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要能打倒那些家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.97,0:03:03.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我什么都愿意做。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:06.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 赐我力量吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.82,0:03:07.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.56,0:03:24.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}吾之力将化为汝之心脏活下去。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.45,0:03:29.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}从今往后，汝与吾一心同体。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.48,0:05:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(星光) 刚才的记忆究竟是……
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.13,0:05:48.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这是？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.67,0:05:55.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(米扎艾尔)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.34,0:05:56.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底发生什么事了。
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.96,0:06:00.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这突如其来的异变难道是毁灭的前兆！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(贝库塔)没错！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.66,0:06:03.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔！？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.29,0:06:08.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光的力量正要觉醒了。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.55,0:06:12.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这混蛋！竟敢恬不知耻地……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.35,0:06:13.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.94,0:06:16.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说利刃杀手作战失败{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:18.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}全都是我的错吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.31,0:06:19.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道不是吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.30,0:06:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都是因为你，星光和游马
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.50,0:06:24.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才进行了新的觉醒啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈 那又怎样？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.86,0:06:30.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连个作战计划都拿不出来你们这群废物{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道比我更厉害吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙……
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.16,0:06:37.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要把你们变成银河眼冰的饵食！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.38,0:06:38.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}住手 米扎艾尔。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.35,0:06:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（贝库塔）你们也应该知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.54,0:06:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}数千年前
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:46.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界的神 上千主上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.24,0:06:50.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为与星光体的战斗被封印在黑暗之中。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.11,0:06:53.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体的力量非常强大。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.60,0:06:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那家伙就这样吸收 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.48,0:06:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}取回原本的力量{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.64,0:07:00.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界就会毁灭。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:04.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以呢！我得到了一个绝密情报。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.93,0:07:05.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.18,0:07:07.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在他们的世界里{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.60,0:07:09.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还没被找到的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.03,0:07:11.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}强力 No.卡有7张。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.59,0:07:14.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找到那家伙让它成为我们的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.76,0:07:17.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}7张 No.卡？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.68,0:07:21.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么啊，那只脏兮兮的苍蝇。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.38,0:07:23.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.67,0:07:26.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝对不脏！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.54,0:07:29.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 痒 痒 痒…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:32.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙是我从恶意之海中复活过来的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.56,0:07:36.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙的真身是那个哈特伯宁！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.35,0:07:40.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～ 那是我的决胜颜艺！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.78,0:07:42.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就那副样子还决胜颜艺？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.76,0:07:44.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}Mr.哈特兰德。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.75,0:07:46.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你想听吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.42,0:07:47.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哈特伯…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.32,0:07:49.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊～！ 痒 痒 痒…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:51.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙知道 No.卡的情报呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:53.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.14,0:07:57.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在费卡博士的实验室里，九十九一马的资料。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.93,0:08:00.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙在异世界之门开启的前兆{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把那23处遗迹全都找出来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.10,0:08:07.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在其中的某处，有最后7张 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.80,0:08:09.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那话是真的{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.29,0:08:13.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在被阿斯特拉尔吸收之前，我们必须先夺过来。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.70,0:08:14.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊，还有，
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.70,0:08:18.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要去他们的世界{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定就能抓住
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.79,0:08:20.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修的线索。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.69,0:08:22.16,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}纳修？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.14,0:08:24.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们原本是7个人。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴里安的七皇。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.58,0:08:29.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是纳修和梅拉格
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.72,0:08:32.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}突然从这个世界上消失了。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.04,0:08:36.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说不定，他们有可能就在他们的世界里。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.56,0:08:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.50,0:08:40.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}多鲁贝！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.84,0:08:42.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些 No.卡，分头去找。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.35,0:08:51.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么～正在打瞌睡的两位啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:56.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就用咚·千的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.03,0:08:57.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你们复活吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.76,0:09:01.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想起来吧，阿里特！基拉古！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}输给游马的那份不甘！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.84,0:09:08.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}贝库塔他们要复活需要花些时间。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.40,0:09:12.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们也去把该办的事办了吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.01,0:09:14.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}知道了。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凌牙）感觉到什么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.71,0:09:28.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.11,0:09:32.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才明明感觉到了很强的气息现在却什么都没有。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:35.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}芋艿的雷达也不行啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.74,0:09:37.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别用那个名字叫我！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.32,0:09:38.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好、好的。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.15,0:09:42.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 大家竟然同时感觉到了什么……。
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.43,0:09:46.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.00,0:09:57.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊…… 咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.38,0:10:01.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等…… 这里是飞艇里面！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.29,0:10:06.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什……什么啊 突然之间吓我一跳啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.12,0:10:09.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抱歉。不过 希望你看看这个。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.22,0:10:14.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}刚才 突然有显示某个地点的地图浮现了出来。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.21,0:10:19.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张地图上的7个点指向的是某处遗迹。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.58,0:10:23.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 那里也是 No.们所在的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:24.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.们？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.43,0:10:28.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 与地图一同这个出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.13,0:10:36.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(一马)游马，星光。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.45,0:10:38.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还有…爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.49,0:10:41.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们会听到这段留言{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.08,0:10:44.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说明事态正朝着最坏的方向发展。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.55,0:10:46.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}尽快去遗迹{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.08,0:10:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}找出那7张 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是些特别的 No.卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.31,0:10:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果它们落入巴利安之手
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.70,0:10:55.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们就会重获强大的力量。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.60,0:10:59.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，星光…绝对不能让 No.卡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.67,0:11:01.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}落入巴利安手中。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.36,0:11:03.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托你们了。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.53,0:11:10.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}爸爸他知道 No.卡的事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.09,0:11:14.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没错，也知道我的事…。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.64,0:11:17.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！爸爸他全都看在眼里啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.12,0:11:20.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}老爸他总是指引着我。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:22.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就相信他，走一趟！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.57,0:11:24.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}的确，没理由把那种力量
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.14,0:11:26.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}交给巴利安那帮家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.97,0:11:27.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也去！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.66,0:11:29.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.33,0:11:32.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙一旦说出口就不会听劝呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.66,0:11:35.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也陪您一起去。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.83,0:11:38.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}既然决定了，游马，出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.67,0:11:39.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}大家……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.12,0:11:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}好嘞！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.80,0:11:43.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}以 No.卡为目标，出发！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.98,0:11:47.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}热血沸腾啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.54,0:11:53.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《纳修……
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:12:00.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这种时候，要是你在的话……》
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.36,0:12:11.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得，风浪好大。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:12.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.07,0:12:15.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这是某种影响波及到了异世界……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:17.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，阿斯特拉尔……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.72,0:12:20.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔世界是个什么样的地方？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.45,0:12:22.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为什么问这个？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.32,0:12:24.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为老爸他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.22,0:12:26.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连Numbers的事都知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.05,0:12:28.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他绝对在阿斯特拉尔世界。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:31.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔世界，只有升级过的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:33.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能抵达的地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.77,0:12:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}灵魂的升级？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.80,0:12:36.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.18,0:12:38.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}也会像怪物那样升级吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:42.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所有生物的灵魂都始终在追求理想。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.27,0:12:45.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}任何人都有升级的可能性。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.45,0:12:47.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那……要怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.51,0:12:49.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}才能完成那个升级啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.79,0:12:51.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个我也不知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.59,0:12:54.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是啊……也就是说
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.11,0:12:56.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你是说，你比我升级得还高？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.11,0:12:58.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总觉得有点没法接受啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.01,0:13:00.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀，阿斯特拉尔比游马更{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.93,0:13:02.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阶级更高这件事，
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.42,0:13:03.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是毫无疑问的哦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.85,0:13:04.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就是嘛。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.85,0:13:09.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马的特技也就是快吃、快塞……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.11,0:13:10.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟同学。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:11.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.48,0:13:13.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！你让我说什么啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.13,0:13:15.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你自己说的吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.50,0:13:17.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}无聊。你们这些人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.95,0:13:19.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一辈子都不可能升级吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.02,0:13:22.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.06,0:13:51.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}糟了……屏障蜥蜴被……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:55.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，原本的力量就没法使用了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.55,0:13:58.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我居然会犯这种错……。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.36,0:14:01.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且，那东西确实星光界的飞行船！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.73,0:14:04.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果是这样的话 这附近应该……。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:16.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这、这家伙是……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.93,0:14:18.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想干架吗 你这混蛋！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.20,0:14:23.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《多鲁贝：星光界……》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.98,0:14:41.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那家伙 对我 怕得逃走了。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.55,0:14:45.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 你 没事吧！？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.68,0:14:46.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等等 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.55,0:14:49.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别随便靠近那家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.77,0:14:51.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《神代凌牙！》
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.07,0:14:54.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼。这家伙 是谁啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.66,0:14:56.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不 虽然不太清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.69,0:14:58.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但好像 受了伤的样子。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:14:59.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很可疑啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.52,0:15:01.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们在异次元空间
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.82,0:15:03.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和某种能量体撞上了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.95,0:15:05.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果那就是巴利安的话这家伙就是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.16,0:15:10.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的名字是纳修。只是个旅行者。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.08,0:15:13.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}旅行者？在这种深山里！？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.04,0:15:16.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}确实太不自然了。应该小心点。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.22,0:15:18.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂，你们几个，等一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:22.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙，要被骗多少次才肯罢休啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.17,0:15:24.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}别轻易相信别人！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.10,0:15:30.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道我知道啊，可是……我……我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.47,0:15:31.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.77,0:15:34.72,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个声音是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.78,0:15:46.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这、这是……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.75,0:15:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们一直寻找的遗迹……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.02,0:15:54.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么说，这其中有 No.卡……。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.41,0:15:56.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《难道他们也
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.48,0:15:58.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}和我们一样，是为了 No.卡……》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.50,0:16:01.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟) 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.24,0:16:03.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}鳥{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.61,0:16:08.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟！小鸟！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.42,0:16:14.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}呜哇 你这～！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.15,0:16:17.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《这座遗迹的某处应该有 No.…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.09,0:16:21.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但以现在这种状态决斗是 做不到的。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:24.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}该怎么办才好…》
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.41,0:16:27.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的 真让人操心啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.78,0:16:30.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因为 蛇可是小鸟的天敌啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.77,0:16:34.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎呀 明明在Astral号船外
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.11,0:16:35.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}却能看见你的身影呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.28,0:16:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}难道我也 升级了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.97,0:16:40.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你在说什么 这么悠哉的话。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.29,0:16:43.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来 从这里往前好像是死路一条啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.56,0:16:45.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真 真的假的啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.05,0:16:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(２人)什么!?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.60,0:16:51.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(小鸟)哎？ 怎么了？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.89,0:16:54.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(杜尔贝)出口！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.01,0:17:00.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 璃绪 退后。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.52,0:17:02.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不知道会发生什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(璃绪)凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}喂 鲨鱼！ 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.54,0:17:13.73,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(凌牙)我没事。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.63,0:17:17.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个机关到底是……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.42,0:17:26.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 通往深处的通道出现了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:28.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啊 这边也是。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.08,0:17:31.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来只能分头前进了。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.02,0:17:35.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个人 叫纳修。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.62,0:17:38.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 好像是来到这附近的旅行者。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.74,0:17:41.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}阿斯特拉尔和鲨鱼 不就是巴利安吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.85,0:17:42.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一直在怀疑。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.45,0:17:45.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？ 巴利安？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.71,0:17:48.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯 但是 我觉得那个……不是的。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.60,0:17:51.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 如果真的是巴利安的话
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.42,0:17:52.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们也会把 No.……
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.63,0:17:59.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}总之刚才的事 谢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.20,0:18:02.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但是 别误会了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:05.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我可不是相信了你啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.15,0:18:08.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不必了。那只是还了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.36,0:18:10.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你朋友的一个人情罢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.85,0:18:12.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}切！说得倒好听。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.83,0:18:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么回事？这个房间。这不是死路一条吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.61,0:18:27.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就这么被结结实实地关在里面了是吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:29.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什、什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.55,0:18:32.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到底怎么回事！？这个地方。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:36.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，看那个。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.59,0:18:43.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是……那就是遗迹的 No.卡！？
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.24,0:18:53.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你、你是！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.69,0:18:58.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（马哈）我是守护这座遗迹 No.卡的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.38,0:18:59.69,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}守护者马哈。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.58,0:19:02.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.卡的守护者？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.39,0:19:06.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来似乎是 No.卡的精灵呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:07.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}精灵？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.58,0:19:10.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我从他身上感受到了非常强烈的思念。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.09,0:19:14.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这 No.卡可不能轻易交给你们。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.12,0:19:17.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你们是否拥有
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.26,0:19:19.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}配得上持有这 No.卡的灵魂{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.48,0:19:20.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我来试探一下。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.31,0:19:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被挑战决斗，我怎么可能逃！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.64,0:19:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗盘 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.94,0:19:31.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}D视镜 设置。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.29,0:19:36.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(2人)决斗！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:39.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！加油！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.58,0:19:43.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那么 开始吧你们这场试炼的决斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.22,0:19:45.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.94,0:19:50.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 里侧守备表示设置怪兽。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.89,0:19:56.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再 盖放2张手牌 回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.07,0:19:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧！ 我的回合 抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.27,0:20:02.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小心点 游马对手可不是等闲之辈。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.11,0:20:03.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.57,0:20:06.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这里是高贵灵魂长眠之地。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.57,0:20:09.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你们能跨越这场试炼{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.24,0:20:13.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}作为代价，他们的灵魂我就收下了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.92,0:20:14.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}他们？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.38,0:20:25.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼！还有纳修！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.94,0:20:32.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(多鲁贝)墙壁开始动了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.45,0:20:34.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}唔！想把我们
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.80,0:20:36.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}用墙壁压成肉饼吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.38,0:20:38.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}凌牙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.34,0:20:41.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太卑鄙了，你这家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:42.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把两个人放了！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.42,0:20:43.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那就要看你们自己了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:47.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在这场决斗中，你们究竟会发现什么。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.95,0:20:49.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《我们要发现？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:52.52,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拯救他们两人的方法
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.52,0:20:54.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就隐藏在这场决斗中吗？》
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.61,0:20:57.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}事到如今 就把你打趴下{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.66,0:20:59.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼他们我一定会救出来！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.48,0:21:03.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤 嘎嘎嘎魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.80,0:21:07.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘎嘎嘎魔术师)嘎～ 嘎嘎嘎！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.63,0:21:09.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后 当嘎嘎嘎怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.08,0:21:10.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在场上时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.53,0:21:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就能特殊召唤这家伙。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:15.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}出来吧！嘎嘎嘎骑士！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.13,0:21:16.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}(嘎嘎嘎骑士)嘎～！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.76,0:21:18.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再发动 嘎嘎嘎骑士的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这家伙特殊召唤时
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.89,0:21:22.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能让场上的1只怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.88,0:21:24.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}等级变得相同。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.88,0:21:26.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎魔术师的等级是4。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.76,0:21:29.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}因此 等级从2变成4。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.04,0:21:32.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 等级4的怪兽就有2只。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:33.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.61,0:21:35.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我知道。以嘎嘎嘎骑士为素材
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:36.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}召唤霍普的话{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.88,0:21:38.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个回合 无法攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.88,0:21:39.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.24,0:21:42.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 魔法卡 嘎嘎嘎标签！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.63,0:21:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}根据这张卡的效果{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.08,0:21:46.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘎嘎嘎怪兽的攻击力 上升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.55,0:21:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此 用这2只向对手攻击{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.92,0:21:53.26,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}在回合结束时打算召唤霍普吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:55.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战术不坏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:58.19,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}但这场决斗 有什么……》
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.39,0:22:04.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}鲨鱼 冲啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.32,0:22:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我一定会 救你的！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.05,0:23:45.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.73,0:23:48.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.85,0:23:50.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.82,0:23:52.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.05,0:23:56.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.60,0:23:58.18,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
